{"results":[{"url":"https://jannathomes.com/project/romell-allure/74","title":"Romell Allure Borivali East, Mumbai | Jannat Homes","raw_content":"# Romell Allure\n\nBy Romell Group\n\nBorivali East, Mumbai\n\nStarting Price  99.00 L\n\nStarting Price 99.00 L\n\n[![](https://jannathomes.com/uploads/gallery/2022/09/14/img_x_500632187a030a0f4-42702656.jpg)](https://jannathomes.com/uploads/gallery/2022/09/14/img_x_500632187a030a0f4-42702656.jpg)\n\n[![](https://jannathomes.com/uploads/gallery/2022/09/14/img_x_5006321878423f2f1-55101654.jpg)](https://jannathomes.com/uploads/gallery/2022/09/14/img_x_5006321878423f2f1-55101654.jpg)\n\n[![](https://jannathomes.com/uploads/gallery/2022/09/14/img_x_50063218785c4ab39-77040896.jpg)](https://jannathomes.com/uploads/gallery/2022/09/14/img_x_50063218785c4ab39-77040896.jpg)\n\n[![](https://jannathomes.com/uploads/gallery/2022/09/14/img_x_50063218787851541-08810012.jpg)](https://jannathomes.com/uploads/gallery/2022/09/14/img_x_50063218787851541-08810012.jpg)\n\n[![](https://jannathomes.com/uploads/gallery/2022/09/14/img_x_500632187893e6068-39771667.jpg)](https://jannathomes.com/uploads/gallery/2022/09/14/img_x_500632187893e6068-39771667.jpg)\n\n[![](https://jannathomes.com/uploads/gallery/2022/09/14/img_x_5006321878aebd892-87496648.jpg)](https://jannathomes.com/uploads/gallery/2022/09/14/img_x_5006321878aebd892-87496648.jpg)\n\n[![](https://jannathomes.com/uploads/gallery/2022/09/14/img_x_5006321878cb599e0-15800125.jpg)](https://jannathomes.com/uploads/gallery/2022/09/14/img_x_5006321878cb599e0-15800125.jpg)\n\n[![](https://jannathomes.com/uploads/gallery/2022/09/14/img_x_5006321878ed703f8-48381034.jpg)](https://jannathomes.com/uploads/gallery/2022/09/14/img_x_5006321878ed703f8-48381034.jpg)\n\n[![](https://jannathomes.com/uploads/gallery/2022/09/14/img_x_50063218790ba71b1-59385657.jpg)](https://jannathomes.com/uploads/gallery/2022/09/14/img_x_50063218790ba71b1-59385657.jpg)\n\n[![](https://jannathomes.com/uploads/gallery/2022/09/14/img_x_50063218792dc9776-74515262.jpg)](https://jannathomes.com/uploads/gallery/2022/09/14/img_x_50063218792dc9776-74515262.jpg)\n\n[![](https://jannathomes.com/uploads/gallery/2022/09/14/img_x_50063218794c9d031-48474530.jpg)](https://jannathomes.com/uploads/gallery/2022/09/14/img_x_50063218794c9d031-48474530.jpg)\n\n[![](https://jannathomes.com/uploads/gallery/2022/09/14/img_x_50063218781de86d2-26673939.jpg)](https://jannathomes.com/uploads/gallery/2022/09/14/img_x_50063218781de86d2-26673939.jpg)\n\n![Configuration](https://jannathomes.com/assets/icons/conf-plan.png)\n\nConfiguration   \n  1,2 BHK\n\n![Carpet Area](https://jannathomes.com/assets/icons/carpert-area.png)\n\nCarpet Area (Sq.ft)  \n  Start : 407 - End : 567\n\n![Price/Sq.ft](https://jannathomes.com/assets/icons/price-tag.png)\n\nPrice/Sq.ft  \n  26278.66\n\n![All in price](https://jannathomes.com/assets/icons/note.png)\n\nAll in one price  \n  99.00 L - 1.49 Cr\n\nNo of Towers\n\nNo of Storeys\n\n22\n\nPossession Status\n\nUnder Construction\n\nPossession Date\n\nMar, 2023\n\nProject Rera No\n\nP51800023445\n\nAdvertiser Rera No\n\nA51800011711\n\n##### Introduction to Romell Allure\n\nRomell Allure is a 22 storey residential project nestled next to the lush green away from the chaos of the city. Romell Allure is located in a heart of nature, Borivali East with peaceful Sanjay Gandhi National park view . Educational Institutes, Healthcare facilities and Recreational activities in close vicinity. The project offers perfect combination of both comfort and connectivity with Western Express Highway, Borivali Railway station and S.V Road with 1 to 3 kilometres.\n\nRomell Allure offers a place to relax and reset with exclusive rooftop amenities such as Swiming pool, Gymnasium, Reflexology path and Yoga Deck. The possession date of the project is March 2023.\n\n[#### Amenities](javascript:void(0);)\n\n* ![](https://jannathomes.com/uploads/amenities/icon/2022/09/07/63183c02c3bac4-84599175.jpg)Elevator\n* ![](https://jannathomes.com/uploads/amenities/icon/2021/07/15/60f05040b0b828-36177329.jpg)Gymnasium\n* ![](https://jannathomes.com/uploads/amenities/icon/2022/09/01/631076c5888133-27323167.jpg)Regular Water Supply\n* ![](https://jannathomes.com/uploads/amenities/icon/2022/09/05/6315a78f420df1-47241807.jpg)Rooftop garden\n* ![](https://jannathomes.com/uploads/amenities/icon/2022/09/01/6310779b4752a9-36414246.jpg)Security\n* ![](https://jannathomes.com/uploads/amenities/icon/2021/07/15/60f0503360a6e5-25837256.jpg)Swimming Pool\n* ![](https://jannathomes.com/uploads/amenities/icon/2021/07/15/60f050680ed615-96265228.jpg)Terrace\n\n[#### Pricing, Floor Plans & Room Sizing](javascript:void(0);)\n\n|  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| Type | Carpet Area | Price () | Floor Plans | Room Sizes | PDF |\n[1 BHK](javascript:void(0))| 1 BHK | 407.00 Sq.ft | 99.00 L | [View](javascript:void(0)) | [View](javascript:void(0)) | [View](https://jannathomes.com/uploads/projects/floor_plan/2023/01/08/330cd9ecbe9cbcab337dcba4f9170b0c.pdf) |\n[2 BHK](javascript:void(0))| 2 BHK | 567.00 Sq.ft | 1.49 Cr | [View](javascript:void(0)) | [View](javascript:void(0)) | [View](https://jannathomes.com/uploads/projects/floor_plan/2023/01/08/0e81e9dfcdd136af69af747e596f8da2.pdf) |\n\n[#### Location](javascript:void(0);)\n\n[#### Romell Group](javascript:void(0);)\n\n![](https://jannathomes.com/uploads/developer/logo/2022/09/01/6310b54b2c9f67-54660769.jpg)\n\n* Established In\n* Total Projects8\n\nThe Romell Group has been significantly making a mark in the ever-evolving iconic skyline of Mumbai. Blending cutting-age technology and exemplary design with sheer determination, some of the most modern, recognizable and unique constructions have the name Romell on them. Our sincere commitment to customers has helped us establish a legacy of trust and dependence, strengthening our foundation every day. Along with the on-time delivery of our projects, we ensure that our customers always come first which in turn has won us prestigious awards, helped us gain recognition and made us a household name in the city over the years.\n\n[#### More Projects by Romell Group](javascript:void(0);)\n\n[![](https://jannathomes.com/uploads/gallery/2022/09/14/img_x_5006321cf4ee97532-33715347.jpg)](https://jannathomes.com/project/romell-vasanthi/79)\n\n#### [Romell Vasanthi](https://jannathomes.com/project/romell-vasanthi/79)\n\nBy Romell Group\n\n2 BHK\n\n1.94 Cr - 2.02 Cr\n\nMulund\n\n[![](https://jannathomes.com/uploads/gallery/2022/09/14/img_x_5006321bdb2a21b81-61110902.jpg)](https://jannathomes.com/project/romell-diva/78)\n\n#### [Romell Diva](https://jannathomes.com/project/romell-diva/78)\n\nBy Romell Group\n\n3 BHK\n\n2.40 Cr - 2.47 Cr\n\nMalad West\n\n[![](https://jannathomes.com/uploads/gallery/2022/09/14/img_x_5006321a664ef0072-48494914.jpg)](https://jannathomes.com/project/romell-serene/77)\n\n#### [Romell Serene](https://jannathomes.com/project/romell-serene/77)\n\nBy Romell Group\n\n2,3 BHK\n\n1.73 Cr - 2.35 Cr\n\nBorivali West\n\n[![](https://jannathomes.com/uploads/gallery/2022/09/14//img_x_5006321a2874e2e82-94330713.jpg)](https://jannathomes.com/project/romell-rhythm/76)\n\n#### [Romell Rhythm](https://jannathomes.com/project/romell-rhythm/76)\n\nBy Romell Group\n\n1 BHK\n\n1.23 Cr - 1.23 Cr\n\nMalad West\n\n[![](https://jannathomes.com/uploads/gallery/2022/09/14/img_x_50063218f1e8ffd78-90266082.jpg)](https://jannathomes.com/project/romell-cornstone/75)\n\n#### [Romell Cornstone](https://jannathomes.com/project/romell-cornstone/75)\n\nBy Romell Group\n\n2 BHK\n\n1.77 Cr - 1.77 Cr\n\nBorivali West\n\n[![](https://jannathomes.com/uploads/gallery/2022/09/14/img_x_5006321801c2e0f44-47177010.jpg)](https://jannathomes.com/project/romell-euphoria/73)\n\n#### [Romell Euphoria](https://jannathomes.com/project/romell-euphoria/73)\n\nBy Romell Group\n\n1 BHK\n\n1.15 Cr - 1.15 Cr\n\nBorivali West\n\n[![](https://jannathomes.com/uploads/gallery/2022/09/14//img_x_500