e-outline.svg)Borivali East](https://www.addressofchoice.com/property-in-borivali-east-mumbai-l1433) [![Developer](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets_new/images/icons/business-outline.svg) By: Romell Group](https://www.addressofchoice.com/property-in-romell-group-d7031)\n\n![Location](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets_new/images/icons/location-outline.svg)Kajupada, Borivali, Mumbai, Maharashtra 400066.\n\n[![Google](https://www.google.com/favicon.ico) Add As A Preferred  \nSource On Google](https://www.google.com/preferences/source?q=Addressofchoice.com)\n\n[![Save](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/new/images/icons/heart-outline.svg)Save](#) [![Review](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/new/images/icons/chatbox-outline.svg) Post A Review](#rating)\n\nPrice Range Starting from\n\n###### 1.05 Cr to 1.48 Cr\\*\n\n# Romell Allure in Borivali East, Mumbai Details | Reviews | Price | Floor Plan | Photos | Master Plan | Brochure | Amenities | Location\n\n![Floor Plan](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/new/images/gallery-floor-plan.jpg \"Floor Plan\")\n\n![Site Plan](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/new/images/gallery-site-plan.jpg \"Site Plan\")\n\n![Romell Allure](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/elevation/49939/1600360107_e1.jpeg \"Romell Allure\")\n\n[![Save](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/new/images/icons/heart-outline.svg)Save](#) [![Review](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/new/images/icons/chatbox-outline.svg) Post A Review](#rating)\n\n#### Are you interested in property?\n\nGet attractive benefits with addressofchoice.com\n\n* [Highlights](#review)\n* [Overview](#overview)\n* [Units](#price_listWarpper)\n* [Specifications](#specifications)\n* [Locality & Price Trends](#locality)\n* [Related Projects](#Projects)\n* [Developers](#Developers)\n* [Review & Ratings](#rating)\n* [FAQs](#faqs)\n\n1 BHK Residential Property \n\nEMI Start at ₹\n\nStatus: **Ready to Move**\n\n[![call](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/new/images/icons/call-outline.svg) CONTACT NOW](javascript:void(0)) [![home](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/new/images/icons/conversation.svg) FAQ's](#faq_Property)\n\n* Apartment Sizes Ranges in Between 360 sqft - 507 sqft.\n* Total Units & Towers: Units & Towers\n* Total Project Area: Acres\n* Possession: December, 2022\n* Rera: P51800023445\n\n## About\n\nRomell Allure is a remarkable Residential project located in the well-connected Borivali East locality of Mumbai. Spanning Details Available Upon Request, the project features Details Available Upon Request in Details Available Upon Request, offering a mix of 1 BHK+1T, to 1 BHK+1T Apartments ranging from 360 sqft to 507 sqft. The address for the project is kajupada, borivali, mumbai, maharashtra 400066..\n\n**Available Property Sizes**\n\nThe Apartments at Romell Allure are available in a variety of sizes. The 1 BHK+1T units start at 360 sqft. The larger 1 BHK+1T Apartments go up to 507 sqft, providing ample space for families of all sizes.\n\n**Price Range**\n\nThe prices for the Apartments at Romell Allure are designed to be accessible, with 1 BHK+1T units priced from 1.05 Cr and 1 BHK+1T Apartments from 1.48 Cr, depending on the size and configuration.\n\n**Developer Information**\n\nThe project is being developed by Romell Group, known for its commitment to quality and timely delivery. RERA registration number for the project is P51800023445 Units. Possession is expected to begin in 2022-12-22, ensuring that the property is well on track for future homeowners.\n\n**Amenities and Features**\n\nRomell Allure is designed to offer a blend of luxury and convenience. Key sports amenities include a Sports Facility, Kids Play Area, Swimming Pool, Gym. For relaxation, the development offers a Lifts, Car Parking, Multipurpose Hall, Club house, Garden. The security features include CCTV for enhanced safety.\n\n**Construction and Specifications**\n\nThe project is constructed using premium materials such as vitrified tiles for flooring, granite countertops in the kitchens, and high-end sanitary ware in the bathrooms. These materials ensure both durability and elegance in every home.\n\n**Key Information**\n\n* Total Area: Details Available Upon Request\n* Units & Towers: Details Available Upon Request, Details Available Upon Request\n* Sizes: 360 sqft to 507 sqft\n* Project Address: kajupada, borivali, mumbai, maharashtra 400066.\n* Type: Residential Apartments\n* Developer: Romell Group\n* RERA Registration No.: P51800023445 Units\n* Possession Start: 2022-12-22\n* Construction Quality: Premium materials, vitrified tiles, granite countertops\n* Security: CCTV\n* Sports Facilities: Sports Facility, Kids Play Area, Swimming Pool, Gym\n* Convenience Amenities: Lifts, Car Parking, Multipurpose Hall, Club house, Garden\n\n**Location Benefits**\n\nRomell Allure benefits from its location in Borivali East, offering great connectivity to schools, hospitals, shopping malls, and public transport systems. This makes it an ideal place to live, especially for families.\n\n**Developer and Project Details**\n\nPossession at Romell Allure will begin in 2022-12-22, and the project is RERA registered under P51800023445 Units. Developed by Romell Group, this project promises a reliable investment for prospective homeowners.\n\n### Sports Amenities\n\n* ![Sports Facility](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/amenities/1528804694_sport-facility.svg) Sports Facility\n* ![Kids Play Area](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/amenities/1528804595_kids-play-area.svg) Kids Play Area\n* ![Swimming Pool](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/amenities/1528804565_swimming-pool.svg) Swimming Pool\n* ![Gym](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/amenities/1528804743_gym.svg) Gym\n\n### Convenience Amenities\n\n* ![Lifts](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/amenities/1528804644_lift.svg) Lifts\n* ![Car Parking](https://www.addressofcho