753/Romell-Group-1553841765412-developer-logo.jpg)\n\n[Romell Group](https://www.magicbricks.com/romell-group-buid-4d423537373533)34 Years Experience\n\n4th Floor, Prius Infinity, Subhash Road, Near Axis Bank, Vile Parle (East), Mumbai - 400057\n\nTotal Projects\n\n32\n\nProjects Completed\n\n23\n\nProjects Ongoing\n\n9\n\nExplore Builder Contact Seller\n\nTotal Projects: 65Projects Completed: 60Projects Ongoing: 5Operating Since: 1992For over 2 decades and counting, The Romell Group has been significant...Read More\n\nAbout Developer\n\nTotal Projects: 65\n\nProjects Completed: 60\n\nProjects Ongoing: 5\n\nOperating Since: 1992\n\nFor over 2 decades and counting, The Romell Group has been significantly making a mark in the ever-evolving iconic skyline of Mumbai. Blending cutting-age technology and exemplary design with sheer determination, some of the most modern, recognizable and unique constructions have the name Romell on them. Our sincere commitment to customers has helped us establish a legacy of trust and dependence, strengthening our foundation every day. Along with the on-time delivery of our projects, we ensure that our customers always come first which in turn has won us prestigious awards, helped us gain recognition and made us a household name in the city over the years.\n\nTHINK OC, THINK ROMELL\n\n[![Image 31: Pata Badlo Life Badlo Offer Banner](https://cdn.staticmb.com/pdpstatic/images/magic-Interior_878-x-403.jpg)](https://property.magicbricks.com/microsite/lp/patabadlolifebadlo/?inc=pblb_web_pdp_pblbbanner_belowhibannere)\n\nIf you like Romell Allure,\n\nDon't miss these similar projects\n\n![Image 32](https://cdn.staticmb.com/pdpstatic/images/logo-magic-homes-animation.svg)\n\n![Image 33: Hirani 24K Residencies photo](https://img.staticmb.com/mbimages/project/Photo_h240_w0/2023/05/05/Project-Photo-1-24K-Residencies-Mumbai-5405821_345_1366_240_0.jpg)\n\n₹1.83 Cr - 2.86 Cr\n\n[Hirani 24K Residencies](https://www.magicbricks.com/hirani-24k-residencie