unch Date\n:   December 2019\n\nTotal Area\n:   2 Acres\n\nTotal Units\n:   400\n\nUnit Sizes\n:   412 - 570.5 sq.ft.\n\n## About the Project\n\nRomell Allure is a residential project offering 1 & 2 BHK residences in Borivali (E).\n\n## Amenities\n\nSwimming Pool\n\nMulti-Purpose Hall\n\nSecurity\n\n## Romell Allure Floor Plans & Layout\n\n## 2 Properties Available for Sale & Rent in Romell Allure\n\n![2 BHK Flat for Sale in Romell Allure](/assets/webp/listing-images-missing.webp)\n\nresidential\n\n### 2 BHK Flat for Sale in Romell Allure\n\nresidential\n\nRomell Allure\n\nCall for Price2 BHKUnfurnished\n\nBy **Seller** • 10/07/2026\n\nAn elegant two-bedroom, hall, and kitchen residence is available for purchase in Romell Allure. This west-facing property offers a carpet area of 575 square feet and is situated on a higher floor, complete with tower parking. Residents will benefit from a range of amenities, including a terrace garden with a swimming pool and a gymnasium. The location is highly convenient, being in close proximity to the Western Express Highway, Borivali National Park, schools, hospitals, a cinema, and a market.\n\n![2 BHK Flat for Sale in Borivali](/assets/webp/listing-images-missing.webp)\n\nresidential\n\n### 2 BHK Flat for Sale in Borivali\n\nresidential\n\nRomell Allure\n\nCall for Price2 BHK\n\nBy **Seller** • 10/07/2026\n\nAn elegant 2BHK flat is available for sale in Romell Allure. This property boasts a carpet area of 587 square feet and is located on a higher floor. It includes amenities such as tower parking, a terrace garden with a swimming pool, and a gym. The location is conveniently situated near the Western Express Highway, Borivali National Park, schools, hospitals, cinemas, and markets, offering excellent connectivity and essential facilities within reach. The property is currently available for sale, with the price available upon request.\n\n## Locality & Connectivity\n\neducation\n\n1nearby\n\n* Vishal Haribhau Chavan College\n\n  