 Romell Allure](/mumbai/studio-apartment-for-rent-in-romell-allure-borivali-east)\n* [1 BHK Flats for Rent in Romell Allure](/mumbai/1-bhk-flat-for-rent-in-romell-allure-borivali-east)\n* [2 BHK Flats for Rent in Romell Allure](/mumbai/2-bhk-flat-for-rent-in-romell-allure-borivali-east)\n* [3 BHK Flats for Rent in Romell Allure](/mumbai/3-bhk-flat-for-rent-in-romell-allure-borivali-east)\n* [4 BHK Flats for Rent in Romell Allure](/mumbai/4-bhk-flat-for-rent-in-romell-allure-borivali-east)\n* [5 BHK Flats for Rent in Romell Allure](/mumbai/5-bhk-flat-for-rent-in-romell-allure-borivali-east)\n* [Commercial Spaces for Rent in Romell Allure](/mumbai/commercial-space-for-rent-in-romell-allure-borivali-east)\n* [Office Spaces for Rent in Romell Allure](/mumbai/office-for-rent-in-romell-allure-borivali-east)\n\n## More about this Location\n\nWhere is Borivali East located in Mumbai?\n\nBorivali East is a prominent residential and commercial locality situated in the northern part of Mumbai, Maharashtra. It is well-known for its strategic location, offering excellent connectivity to other parts of the city, and is notably close to the expansive Sanjay Gandhi National Park, providing residents with access to green spaces and nature.\n\nWhat are the transportation options available in Borivali East?\n\nBorivali East boasts robust transportation infrastructure. It is a major railway hub with the Borivali railway station on the Western Line. The area also benefits from metro connectivity via the Magathane Metro Station and Borivali East Metro Station. Additionally, an extensive network of BEST buses ensures seamless local and regional travel for commuters.\n\nWhat is the lifestyle like in Borivali East?\n\nBorivali East offers a vibrant and balanced lifestyle, blending urban conveniences with a sense of community. Residents enjoy access to numerous shopping centers, diverse dining options, and recreational spaces like Veer Savarkar Udyan. The presence of reputed educational institutions and healthcare facilities further enhances the quality of life in the locality.\n\nWhat are the real estate trends in Borivali East?\n\nBorivali East is a highly sought-after real estate destination in Mumbai, characterized by consistent demand for residential properties. The area offers a wide range of housing options, from compact 1 BHK apartments to spacious 3 BHK flats. Its robust infrastructure, excellent connectivity, and comprehensive amenities make it an attractive choice for both homebuyers and investors.\n\nAre there any prominent residential projects in Borivali East?\n\nYes, Borivali East features several notable residential projects catering to various preferences. Completed projects include Rustomjee Pinnacle and Samet Sikar Mahal by HARIKO PROPERTIES LLP. Upcoming developments like Apurva Vaishali CHSL by Nakasha Group and Omkareshwar by TRIUMPH VENTURES are also adding modern living spaces to the locality, offering diverse amenities.\n\nWhat educational and healthcare facilities are available in Borivali East?\n\nThe locality is well-equipped with reputable educational and healthcare institutions. Prominent schools include St. Francis D'Assisi High School and St. Francis Institute of Technology (SFIT). For medical needs, residents have access to well-known hospitals such as Apex Hospitals Borivali, Arihant Superspeciality Hospital, and Karuna Hospital, ensuring comprehensive care.\n\nWhat are the key attractions or highlights of Borivali East?\n\nA major highlight of Borivali East is its close proximity to the Sanjay Gandhi National Park, offering residents a unique opportunity for nature retreats and outdoor activities. The area also features various gardens like Veer Savarkar Udyan and is a bustling commercial hub with diverse shopping, entertainment, and dining options, making it a self-sufficient locality.\n\n## Explore Projects in Popular Locations near Romell Allure\n\n### Education\n\n* St Francis Institute Of Technology Sfit Borivali