nities  \nProject has 25+ amenities with likes of -  \nSwimming Pool  \nParty Lounge  \nOpen Air Screen Zone  \nSenior Citizen Lounge  \nFitness Center & many more  \n  \nRomell Group Allure Borivali East Parking -  \nProject has one type of car parking facility -  \n1) Parking Tower  \n  \nRomell Allure Possession -  \nRera Possession - Ready to move  \nTarget Possession - Ready to move  \n  \nCarpet Area & Floor Plan  \nAllure Borivali East project has 1BHK, 2BHK premium residences with -  \n1BHK - (407 to 419) sqft  \n2BHK - (567 to 586) sqft  \n  \nRomell Allure floor plan  \nTower floor plan will have 4 flats, 2 lifts & 1 staircase on each floor  \n  \nAllure Borivali East project sample flat is ready to view at the site.  \n  \nRomell Allure Mumbai Prices & its details can be found in the price section & Romell Allure Borivali East brochure can be downloaded from the link mentioned below. Project has been praised by the home buyers & Romell Group Borivali East review is 4 out of 5 from over all the clients who have visited the site\n\n## Romell Allure Location\n\nNear WEH, Kajupada, Borivali East, Mumbai\n\n* Western Express Highway - 950m\n* Ovari Pada Metro Station - 1.3km\n* Borivali Railway Station - 2.1km\n\n![360 background](/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimage%2F360-background-image.webp&w=1280&q=75)\n\n![Housiey Logo](/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimage%2Flogo1.png&w=256&q=75)\n\n![360](/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimage%2Ficons%2F360-tour-icon.png&w=128&q=75)\n\n## Romell Allure Videos\n\n## Romell Allure Pros & Cons\n\n![Pros-icon](/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimage%2Ficons%2Fthumbs-up-icon.svg&w=64&q=75)\n\nPros\n\n![toggle-arrow](/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimage%2Ficons%2Farrow-down-icon.svg&w=64&q=75)\n\n1.The project is strategically located near the Western Express Highway, offering excellent connectivity to the metro, railway stations, malls, and other key urban conveniences.\n\n![Cons-icon](/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimage%2Ficons%2Fthumbs-down-icon.svg&w=64&q=75)\n\nCons\n\n![toggle-arrow](/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimage%2Ficons%2Farrow-down-icon.svg&w=64&q=75)\n\n1.The apartments do not include balconies, so if having a balcony is important to you, this project may not be the right fit.\n\n## Romell Allure Amenities\n\n### Internal Amenities\n\n![Vitrified Tiles](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/amenities/1652438961711-img.webp)\n\nVitrified Tiles\n\n![Granite Kitchen Platform](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/amenities/granite-kitchen-platform_External_1770712604025-330259421.webp)\n\nGranite Kitchen Platform\n\n![Stainless Steel Sink](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/amenities/1646987626444-img.webp)\n\nStainless Steel Sink\n\n### External Amenities\n\n![Swimming Pool](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/amenities/1652447054692-img.webp)\n\nSwimming Pool\n\n![Kids Play Area](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/amenities/1652446278292-img.webp)\n\nKids Play Area\n\n![Senior Citizen Area](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/amenities/1652446899508-img.webp)\n\nSenior Citizen Area\n\n![Private Spa](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/amenities/1652446726980-img.webp)\n\nPrivate Spa\n\n![Steam Room](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/amenities/1652447014345-img.webp)\n\nSteam Room\n\n![Yoga Zone](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/amenities/1652447479516-img.webp)\n\nYoga Zone\n\n![Seating Area](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/amenities/seating-area_External_1770882751990-34368358.webp)\n\nSeating Area\n\n![party lawn](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/amenities/party-lawn_External_1770789871561-959473538.webp)\n\nparty lawn\n\n![Open Air Cinema](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/amenities/open-air-cinema_External_1770789795907-956585794.webp)\n\nOpen Air Cinema\n\n![Gymnasium](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/amenities/gymnasium_External_1770730220696-33756910.webp)\n\nGymnasium\n\n![Fitness Deck](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/amenities/fitness-deck_External_1770717977981-642672531.webp)\n\nFitness Deck\n\n## Romell Allure Master & Floor Plan\n\n### Master Plan\n\n![Romell Allure Master Plan](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/project_images/Romell_Allure_Floor_Plan--1692785103149-img-1280w.webp)\n\n### Floor Plan\n\n![Romell Allure Floor Plan](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/project_images/Romell_Allure_Floor_Plan--1692785117948-img-1280w.webp)\n\n## Romell Allure Pricing & Unit Plans\n\n| Carpet Area | All Inc. Price  (Inc. of Taxes & Charges) | Min Downpayment  (Inc. Taxes) | Parking | Unit Plan |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| 407 sqftSold Out | - | - |\n| 410 sqftSold Out | - | - |\n| 419 sqftSold Out | - | - |\n\nCarpet:407 sqft\n\n![Unit plan - 407 sq.ft.](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/unit_plans/Romell_Allure_1_BHK_407_sqft_Unit_Plan--1692786288739-img.webp)\n\n![Sold Out](/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimage%2FsoldOut.jpeg&w=1280&q=75)\n\n-All Inc. Price(Inc. of Taxes & Charges)\n\n-\n\nMin Downpayment(Inclusive Taxes)\n\n-Parking\n\nDown Payment\n\nLoan Amount\n\nInterest\n\nDuration\n\n₹0EMI\n\nCarpet:410 sqft\n\nCarpet:419 sqft\n\n## Romell Allure Payment Scheme\n\nRegular Standard Slabwise Payment as per construction, Maximum loan possible up to 90%\n\n## Romell Allure Litigation Details\n\nIs there any litigation against this proposed project:\n\nNo\n\n## Documents For Romell Allure\n\n![category icon](/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimage%2Ficons%2Flegal-paper-icon.png&w=64&q=75)\n\n### Commencement Certificate\n\n![pdf icon](/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimage%2Ficons%2Fpdf-icon.png&w=64&q=75)\n\nRomell Allure Commencement Certificate\n\n![category icon](/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimage%2Ficons%2Flegal-paper-icon.png&w=64&q=75)\n\n### Legal Title Report\n\n![pdf icon](/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimage%2Ficons%2Fpdf-icon.png&w=64&q=75)\n\nRomell Allure Legal Title Report\n\n![category icon](/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimage%2Ficons%2Flegal-paper-icon.png&w=64&q=75)\n\n### Layout Plan\n\n![pdf icon](/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimage%2Ficons%2Fpdf-icon.png&w=64&q=75)\n\nRomell Allure Layout Plan\n\nNote: You can download more detailed documents by following this [link](https://maharerait.maharashtra.gov.in/public/project/view/29681)\n\n## Romell Allure QR Codes\n\n[![RERA QR code - P51800023445](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/RERA-QR-images/rera_qr_code_1749811628604-185870943.webp)\n\nP51800023445](https://maharerait.maharashtra.gov.in/public/project/view/29681)\n\n## Project approved by\n\n## About Romell Group\n\nRomell Group\n\n![Romell Group](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/builders/logo--1692784230627-img.webp)\n\n1 CityLocations\n\nMumbai suburban\n\n21 yearsExperience\n\n60Total Projects\n\n2K+Happy Families\n\nThe Romell Group success story was built on the passion and dedication of Jude Romell and Dominic Romell which has been inculcated in the values of the brand and our completed projects stand testament to this promise. The level of satisfaction is truly unmatched when we turn our customers’ dream homes into reality, especially the middle-income groups for whom owning a home in this beautiful city is a dream that they work so hard towards fulfilling.\n\n## Frequently Asked Question\n\nYes, a sample flat is available for viewing. Currently, the 1BHK/2BHK show flat is ready and can be visited. Book a free site visit through Housiey and our team will arrange everything.\n\nThe expected possession date is **01 September 2025** as per RERA. Construction is currently **100%** complete as of April 10, 2026. Target possession is **01 September 2025**.\n\nYes, it is RERA registered. The RERA number is **P51800023445**.  \nYou can verify it on the official RERA portal: <https://maharerait.maharashtra.gov.in/public/project/view/29681>\n\nNo, it has no pending litigation. All legal documents including the Commencement Certificate and Legal Title Report are available on Housiey for review before booking.\n\nThe following legal documents are available on Housiey: **Commencement Certificate**, **Legal Title Report**, **Layout Plan**, **Proforma Allotment Letter**. You can preview them directly on the project page or verify them independently on the official RERA portal using RERA number **P51800023445**.\n\nThis project offers **14+** amenities. Key external amenities include Fitness Deck, Gymnasium, Open Air Cinema, party lawn, and Seating Area.  \n Internal specifications include Stainless Steel Sink and Granite Kitchen Platform. The complete amenities list is available on Housiey.\n\nMonthly maintenance details are available in the price sheet. You can download it from the project page on Housiey.\n\nIn Romell Allure, the 1BHK units are available in the following carpet area options:  \n• **407 sq. ft.**  \n• **410 sq. ft.**  \n• **419 sq. ft.**  \nEach configuration may differ slightly in layout, balcony size, or orientation. Our team can walk you through floor plans for each option during your consultation or site visit.\n\nIn Romell Allure, the 2BHK units are available in the following carpet area options:  \n• **567 sq. ft.**  \n• **574 sq. ft.**  \n• **586 sq. ft.**  \nEach configuration may differ slightly in layout, balcony size, or orientation. Our team can walk you through floor plans for each option during your consultation or site visit.\n\nThe all-inclusive price of a 1BHK in Romell Allure starts from **₹1.05 Cr** and varies depending on the carpet area and floor level you choose.   \n• **407 sq. ft.** – ₹1.05 Cr (all-inclusive)  \n• **410 sq. ft.** – ₹1.07 Cr (all-inclusive)  \n• **419 sq. ft.** – ₹1.11 Cr (all-inclusive)  \nThe price includes the base cost, applicable stamp duty, registration charges, GST, and possession charges. Final pricing may vary based on unit configuration, selected floor, and availability.\n\nThe all-inclusive price of a 2BHK in Romell Allure starts from **₹1.56 Cr** and varies depending on the carpet area and floor level you choose.   \n• **567 sq. ft.** – ₹1.56 Cr (all-inclusive)  \n• **574 sq. ft.** – ₹1.56 Cr (all-inclusive)  \n• **586 sq. ft.** – ₹1.56 Cr (all-inclusive)  \nThe price includes the base cost, applicable stamp duty, registration charges, GST, and possession charges. Final pricing may vary based on unit configuration, selected floor, and availability.\n\nIt is built across **0.5 acres** with **1** towers with **G+22** floors. Each floor has **4** flats per floor, **2** lifts, **1** staircases. It is available in **1BHK/2BHK** configurations with carpet areas ranging from **407** to **586 sq. ft.**\n\nRomell Allure provides dedicated car parking facilities for residents. The exact parking type and the number of spaces allotted per unit are mentioned in the Unit Plan, which you can download for free on the Romell Allure project page on Housiey.\n\nIt is located at **Near WEH, Kajupada, Borivali East, Mumbai**.  \nNearby landmarks include:  \n**• Western Express Highway - 950m**   \n**• Ovari Pada Metro Station - 1.3km**   \n**• Borivali Railway Station - 2.1km**\n\nThe following payment plans are available:  \n• **CLP ( Construction Link plan)** - Regular Standard Slabwise Payment as per construction, Maximum loan possible up to 90%  \n  \n**Note:** In some cases, payment plan deviations can be considered based on your preferred terms. The final schedule is confirmed after your site visit.\n\nThe minimum down payment starts from **₹16.00 Lacs**, inclusive of all taxes. EMI options are also available. Use the EMI calculator on the project page to check monthly instalments based on your loan amount and tenure.\n\nYes, it is approved by leading banks including **Central Bank of India**, **Union Bank of India**, **Bank Of India**, **Bank Of Baroda**, **Citi Bank**, **Kotak Mahindra Bank**, **Axis Bank**, **State Bank Of India**, **ICICI Bank**, **HDFC BANK**. The complete approved bank list is available in the Banks section on Housiey. Home loan eligibility depends on the bank's lending policy and your profile.\n\nNo - Housiey follows a strict no-brokerage policy. You pay only the builder's official price - no commission, no hidden charges, and no middlemen. This applies to all projects listed on Housiey.\n\nIt is developed by **Romell Group**, a trusted real estate brand with over **21 years** of experience and more than **60 completed projects** across **Mumbai suburban**.  \n**Some of their notable developments include:**  \n  \n • **Romell Espalier** in Vile Parle East, Mumbai  \n  \n • **Romell Asrava** in Andheri West, Mumbai  \n  \n • **Romell Ariana** in Borivali West, Mumbai  \n  \n • **Romell Orbis** in Andheri East, Mumbai  \n  \n • **Romell Serene** in Borivali West, Mumbai\n\nYes, the Commencement Certificate and Legal Title Report are available on Housiey. You can download them from the Documents section or verify them on the RERA portal.\n\nYes - book a free site visit through Housiey. We arrange a free Ola cab pickup and drop from your location.  \n  \nAlternatively, you can schedule an online project presentation directly by the builder from home. Both options are 100% free with no obligation to buy.\n\nYes - NRIs can purchase this project under FEMA regulations. Payment can be made via NRE or NRO accounts. Home loans are available from Indian banks with a co-applicant. Housiey's team assists NRI buyers with documentation and Power of Attorney requirements remotely - 100% free.\n\n**Borivali East** is one of Mumbai's sought-after micro-markets with consistent property appreciation.  \n  \nThis project by **Romell Group** - with 21 years of experience - offers 1BHK/2BHK at ₹1.05 Cr to ₹1.56 Cr, making it a strong long-term investment opportunity.\n\nBuying through Housiey gives you:  \n(1) No brokerage - you pay the builder's exact price  \n(2) Free Ola cab site visit  \n(3) Online project presentation by the builder from home  \n(4) Free legal consultation via Housiey Legal  \n(5) Honest Pros & Cons review on every project  \nAll services are 100% free with no obligation.\n\nThe price sheet and brochure for this project are available for free download on Housiey. Click the \"Price Sheet\" or \"Brochure\" button on the project page. No registration is required for instant download.\n\nHousiey has a **4.8 rating** on Google with **2,395+ reviews**.  \n  \nOver **8,500 families** have purchased homes through Housiey across **8+ cities** with no brokerage and direct builder pricing. Housiey has conducted **1.2 lakh+ free site visits** and facilitated over **₹8,000 crore** worth of property transactions.\n\n## Explore Related Projects\n\n![Fortune Florence](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/project_images/Fortune_Florence_Elevation--1692948804343-img-1280w.webp)\n\n[### Fortune Florence](/projects/fortune-florence)\n\n₹ 3.11 Cr - 4.70 Cr (All inc)\n\n[Fortune Group](/builder/fortune-group)\n\n879- 1341sqft\n\nBorivali East\n\nMay 2027\n\n2BHK\n\n879sqft\n\n₹3.11 Cr\n\n2BHK\n\n939sqft\n\n₹3.31 Cr\n\n2BHK\n\n959sqft\n\n₹3.38 Cr\n\n2.5BHK\n\n1033sqft\n\n₹3.63 Cr\n\n2.5BHK\n\n1077sqft\n\n₹3.78 Cr\n\n2BHKLimited\n\n901sqft\n\n₹3.18 Cr\n\n3BHKLimited\n\n1341sqft\n\n₹4.70 Cr\n\n3BHKSold Out\n\n1235sqft\n\n-\n\n[Fortune Group](/builder/fortune-group)Developer\n\n![Chandak Greenairy](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/project_images/Chandak_Greenairy_Elevation--1717506604898-img-1280w.webp)\n\n[### Chandak Greenairy](/projects/chandak-greenairy)\n\n₹ 2.59 Cr - 6.14 Cr (All inc)\n\n[Chandak Group](/builder/chandak-group)\n\n418- 1378sqft\n\nBorivali East\n\nJun 2028\n\n2BHK\n\n618sqft\n\n₹2.59 Cr\n\n2BHK\n\n618sqft\n\n₹2.59 Cr\n\n2BHK\n\n650sqft\n\n₹2.72 Cr\n\n2BHK\n\n650sqft\n\n₹2.72 Cr\n\n2BHK\n\n661sqft\n\n₹2.97 Cr\n\n2BHK\n\n661sqft\n\n₹2.97 Cr\n\n2BHK\n\n669sqft\n\n₹3.01 Cr\n\n2BHK\n\n669sqft\n\n₹3.01 Cr\n\n(1+1)BHK Jodi\n\n899sqft\n\n₹4.00 Cr\n\n(1+1)BHK Jodi\n\n899sqft\n\n